#: scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5445723a97e491d870fd6c7afaa682fe0b1a7a3ea7fb03c7554ef4cc42cbf151
#. default-sha256: 10e6afdb6446c06aebd527630130db244c972f81a2575af783f67537eb63ef3d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Several days had passed since the "
"package arrived; ⟪k:12⟫the end of my third week living in the mansion was drawing near."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫짐이 온 지 며칠이 지났고――,"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫내가 이 저택에 온 지 ⟪k:15⟫20일이 지나려 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2247fc9d3c0f76a279e52bfedad41d9d96f51a667dc6fafcb18642e95496eab5
#. default-sha256: caa22b5a2442e3ce9a5ab82935385bf6a84b90344522801472af6e3d936a95d6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel wasn’t getting any friendlier, either. ⟪k:1⟫He continued to either snub or bluntly "
"dismiss me whenever we crossed paths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸은 그 후로도 ⟪k:1⟫일관적으로 ⟪k:2⟫싸늘한 태도를 취했다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫나를 꺼리며 ⟪k:5⟫거절하"
"는 말……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e69dc0389922277c95b0bcc5521ada312511395e5e2f485c7655974f8e46d741
#. default-sha256: 2d4ecf4e1699ed67808bed8d9deb774f9f43c8ca6fbea8dd1a6b61debb64e73a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t understand why he acted that way around me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……미셸이 왜 ⟪k:1⟫그런 태도를 취하는지 ⟪k:2⟫모르겠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91ff2ec296bbc5d9632327ab5383012cb0d82f14b439eaff39a18454e29c2431
#. default-sha256: 9e56a48d97172574fe6e00c25d177e8f4284f34f4f1495ecaec3c409c465131c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there was little point in asking when he seemed to think there was little point in "
"talking to me at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이유를 묻고 싶어도 ⟪k:1⟫소통 자체가 불가능했다. ⟪k:2⟫처음부터 ⟪k:3⟫나와 말을 나누는 걸 ⟪k:4⟫"
"무의미하게 여기는 것 같았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21b8e35d3d36182e5a9e2c109307c3e27731424fcbd0396b78ec1dd799843e6a
#. default-sha256: 9037d987cff37abcf1d6ef06dc878e750e057c3b27ee1e6660fbf898f721722e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although at first I had been sure there was some way to get him to warm up to me,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫처음에는 애써 ⟪k:1⟫거리를 좁히려 했지만……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d00c1e4eda3ced5c495e6ecc3fd79898d297dcdc93af741eb7d11334903ab775
#. default-sha256: 7e6b0c806dd14bbb65cd20276f9a1ff4604d99fade9e71e503923dc81e0f7f29
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the more time I spent in the mansion, the more my willpower began to feel like it was at its "
"breaking point."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸과 지내는 나날 속에서,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 마음과 ⟪k:3⟫의지가 ⟪k:4⟫꺾이려는 내가 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef91b41550510f46aec59939ff415b9d39e5d93e443a5e95dff1b23c9cd75b14
#. default-sha256: cdee3fbc4e4dffebfc3c4232850a946294c44d0bb17f638cdc29f536d0d9484f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could tell myself to stay positive until I was blue in the face,⟪k:1⟫but it would only "
"work for so long."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아무리 긍정적으로 굴려 해도……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫한계가 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bff735e50c9d9acc75f0fcdf51213d9af522074a76a9ac6c1545359f1c9cf273
#. default-sha256: 0e3bd2e2de997ad1a635ca04473740efc18131b8682e8a38a05f53a06383297f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(The one pretty place in the whole house...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(역시 ⟪k:2⟫여긴……, ⟪k:3⟫여기만큼은 아름다워……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d188406a6aca54755e6947e1ca8083d56e6b276d8c49830357b66a8f8fae43bc
#. default-sha256: 7a2157320912dcf0f975e0a5397174f038841799d6329b84edc21d07e514caa7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m glad he hasn’t covered it back up.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(또 가려 놓지 않아서 다행이야……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ec341c6de4311049985360f618f5aac1b76e99cedc433a1ad91e3b87c7a1089
#. default-sha256: 81a4702efb57e335ef4c6cfc3e4d869299da8e5ecec0390e8646bf21a51fb848
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blue moonlight shone quietly through the stained-glass window,⟪k:1⟫vainly illuminating some "
"of the room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫스테인드 글라스는 ⟪k:1⟫달빛을 짊어졌다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫희푸르고 공허한 빛이 ⟪k:4⟫고요히 내리쬐었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62ab8734f7e7466e28c7d9d6ba386fb1c0bf953b4c3d67c44f0168214ea9d8a8
#. default-sha256: 7213f55395eccb674eb0463e51d682c382b6e7f29b56c0024b687a450857a6ea
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t noticed until now, but the room with the stained-glass window appeared to be "
"modeled after a chapel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫처음에는 몰랐는데, ⟪k:1⟫스테인드 글라스가 있는 방은⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아무래도 교회와 똑같은 구조인가 "
"보다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55beccdb2059c8a65b85c004173ce23ac7a390349ac5c2708780ca16ff9c9f20
#. default-sha256: 13bc388784e180a5bca033c8704790d7f69966a3dc994fad06a73b982efc8ef1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Rows of pews faced the window, below which sat what used to be a pulpit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫긴 의자가 스테인드 글라스와 마주하는 방향으로 정렬되어 있다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그리고 ⟪k:3⟫스테인드 글"
"라스 밑에는 설교대였던 것이―― 있다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6d95548764cdc2dbabf2c6fdcf007f3b001fb271bf8281bb966f84b7e65aaa2
#. default-sha256: a6dc581619a5d6bda11f9b9020b12065fe8286a1117cc4fd36f0de110cc89b3d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was very little left of it, though, and an awkward length of silver was mounted to the "
"pulpit’s front face—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫과거형인 이유인즉, ⟪k:1⟫이미 ⟪k:2⟫부서지려는 상태라 그렇다. ⟪k:3⟫어중간한 길이의 은제 막대기"
"가 ⟪k:4⟫설교대에 덩그러니 남아 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17decce1642aac016dfdb3d96e4fc900b8e274334f7ba084773cc12750ca4a38
#. default-sha256: 38a96a4c11c51b23e53217e21d071e2496613f83fbee17ea3ff4bc207ec0bd33
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫what was, I assumed, formerly a cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아마 ⟪k:1⟫저건…… 십자가였을 것이다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6ac002fea956ce0b94d2eced44b03121b6e883ed39c7367156731f8d6d1d93a
#. default-sha256: 78769d3a0825d9f6004eb0069ff7eaff59cadc662e594e5acabc13296bcdc509
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Upon further reflection, rather than facing the window, the pews seemed to be pointed at the "
"pulpit—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps the cross hanging on it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫긴 의자들은 스테인드 글라스가 아닌, ⟪k:1⟫설교대의 신부님을――⟪k:2⟫혹은 십자가를 ⟪k:3⟫보는 구도"
"이리라."

#: scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcf05c7b221b63ab4d40fa4b4b35d3ddc6fd83d40d806dac1b157977ac789474
#. default-sha256: c9112706ba9d66c3ec6402562310a001814840b192ae0e7a38c98fc78d305a76
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure why there would be a chapel in a mansion, but I had no one to ask about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어째서 저택 안에 ⟪k:1⟫교회가 있는지 의문이 들었지만, ⟪k:2⟫그걸 묻는 건 불가능했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10a51d43d35cf33fa10d992972831d9cc49db3957efefa1ce134f73c0e6b8029
#. default-sha256: 64aaab9c3138c809340a8565d0ae4967279355226efe920b08c276ec5de40e40
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(For a house of this size, a statue of Christ or the Virgin Mary seems more appropriate.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(집 규모가 이만하니까 ⟪k:1⟫예수님이나 마리아 님 석상만 둬도 충분할 텐데)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfa23a103e9b8f23939eff8e53dd8910234867103ad03201d3b5387b877e1fe6
#. default-sha256: 929e5e6c8331bf37a450620af4503f3cc625924254531bd12b7acc69c5e7090d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It’s a very well made chapel, at any rate...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(많이 ⟪k:1⟫튼실히 만들어진 방인걸……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdbf8e0db552e5bf773e196192892277dcf2d29d6f73cea9f5d58979879e507e
#. default-sha256: 1f3fd1c282b5267771985b918c788f548bc8d64ac8667456e2778ad8f7fbfaf8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I doubted Michel had had it built for himself. ⟪k:1⟫There would be no reason for him to "
"cover the window if that were the case."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸이 본인을 위해 차린 방―― 같지는 않다. ⟪k:1⟫그게 맞다면 ⟪k:2⟫애초에 스테인드 글라스를 가리"
"진 않을 것이고……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 424a656bd11d4e367b2c99fad2ced8efbeb0770ac87c1f8869642165b5038a59
#. default-sha256: 83985f8e4b79af5f83cf95548c4810d650668bbc791774068270f732fde97686
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor had I ever seen him come to pray."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸이 기도하러 오는 걸 ⟪k:1⟫본 적도 없으니 말이다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1faafb176906e8e8b27a773ab4db34fd9701badb48192a9ca9c948bd68f769f7
#. default-sha256: 44d5ff669666014b5b8d8ae45b3d80a1515f11e838dd94aae095b49cd076cb51
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He doesn’t seem like one to believe in God.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(신을 ⟪k:1⟫믿지도 않을 것 같지……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a3585cb0c60a68b033f7370ad7960ce3d37bc734a5ba5f46fb67565edcdf136
#. default-sha256: 2b22287f4dbbc58a5ccc1daef2d1f544f81eb7eedd8d072159937bffc658ab38
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(God...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(……신⟪k:1⟫이라……)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17305c4f5deb294cc5dc80bb4ee620408800a7b07397f2939f6308c819f87c9c
#. default-sha256: 79155d4824ed05098f83408ecafc13bbef58d980baf24c2c2f51cf7c9f3b7412
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m not even sure if I...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(나도 ⟪k:1⟫진작에………)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd07cb64f35898a7bccab4a5ebc4ddf4d256ab363830005c87c7fff3f491c42c
#. default-sha256: 1824bf2ce57d8b8aa504b3c5b9137de6dec027abe9867cd2044f6db41a4435e9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If God ⟪k:1⟫really⟪k:2⟫ existed, then surely the world would be a much more pleasant, "
"peaceful place."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫만약 이 세상에 신이 정말로 존재한다면,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이 세상은 훨씬 평온할 텐데――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C
