msgid "⟪k:0⟫See, how about that? Not bad, huh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫어때? ⟪k:2⟫그럴싸하지? ⟪k:3⟫완벽하지?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FA3C4960_0090_4DB9_A136_AE19BD13C50B
