msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whaaaat? You really think it sounded forced?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫에엥~, ⟪k:1⟫연기 티가 나나……?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BBE9BDA6_48F2_47DA_B25B_574FCCB09C29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebfb3f98e8f5829da4f2ea53268524917259456fb4ea3c75b4f8da4716123435
#. default-sha256: 76184ab930df1b8915ec032a7cb0ed0bd63577649e3ffc7a50788f352cc2c30a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BBE9BDA6_48F2_47DA_B25B_574FCCB09C29"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was the daughter of a merchant who ran a shop on the capital’s main street. ⟪k:3⟫"
"My father had passed away in a plague, so it was just me, my mother, and my older sister."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……나는 ⟪k:3⟫수도 대로변에 가게를 차린 ⟪k:4⟫상인 집안 딸이었다. ⟪k:5⟫아빠는 돌림병으"
"로 죽었고, ⟪k:6⟫엄마와 나, ⟪k:7⟫언니 셋이서 살았다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A82401E_5D9A_4708_898A_C2F4F14E7BCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69a0e08a8b923bc56de20938e2d21efad3ce198ef215052e81e37b3310a34afe
#. default-sha256: 21c7e9c1c096070ba5f02383c2d83f87bda63093cdb07155e7344811c99ca853
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A82401E_5D9A_4708_898A_C2F4F14E7BCC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It would be a lie to say business was doing well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫가게 경영이 잘 풀린단 말은 빈말로라도 못 했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF63D0AB_643C_4138_8E9E_91DC1B719EC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49b14eaddf0e3ea1c62c2afd6bfe652fbf5b0d178aa0d09482da43b7051233eb
#. default-sha256: 768e2875bc93de92c91f6b74844e6fc8309b3ee27e80dea1b828158bf4b7f317
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF63D0AB_643C_4138_8E9E_91DC1B719EC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We struggled to squeak by day-to-day after taxes...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but we couldn’t just abandon "
"the shop and leave the capital either..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫납부하는 세금 때문에 ⟪k:1⟫입에 풀칠하기도 힘들었는데……, ⟪k:2⟫그렇다고 정작 ⟪k:3⟫가게를 버리"
"고 수도에서 떠날 수도 없었다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_778A2AAE_CCB7_42BA_B2C6_85F3D97DBA6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7c29ca477bab4f36fa5639fcbdfc9d6499b27ec25f417aabc757e211f6d9e52
#. default-sha256: e2d5466e758c94a084ed4cf6c510a1933ad5745d07092d72bc80c4999c7c1ae0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_778A2AAE_CCB7_42BA_B2C6_85F3D97DBA6F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we tried to make the best of what we were able to take in between the three of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫셋이서 일용할 양식을 근근이 나눠 먹는 ⟪k:1⟫검소한 생활."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2dd334961e3a35552f4eb38ad40ccbcdd57d755736a1b0b858343e2eb34d8a3f
