msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then, my sister fell in love with a moderately well-off aristocrat. ⟪k:1⟫Both my mom and I "
"were supportive of her and her desire to marry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그런 와중에 ⟪k:1⟫언니가 사랑에 빠진 상대는 ⟪k:2⟫중류 귀족이었다. ⟪k:3⟫나와 엄마는 진심으로 축"
"복하며 ⟪k:4⟫둘이 결혼하길 바랐다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d468c50635993875d62e540c48c210147a1acc353e41c12a98b5e229a52aa40
#. default-sha256: d2cc3e4b4d099e2aea5414d84d402c685695ced6b1ed49dedef6e911a5ce5613
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But their union almost fell apart because she was “not suitable” for him. ⟪k:1⟫Merchants "
"were hardly the lowest class—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫격이 안 맞는단 이유로 혼담이 취소되려 했다. ⟪k:2⟫상인은 결코 신분이 미천한 정도까"
"진 아니다――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0949ED31_09F9_472D_B559_50857937E097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9ea16301ac308d73074b9192ec521084821b498e043a89f292eb39855e7fb3c
