msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If only we had money, my sister could get married.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If only we had money, my mom "
"wouldn’t have to work so hard."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫돈만 있으면 ⟪k:1⟫언니는 결혼할 수 있다. ⟪k:2⟫돈만 있으면 ⟪k:3⟫엄마도 편해진다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0F44F0A0_0406_4329_AD33_CC802B3A9D7E
